.DS_Store
# .env.production is deliberately NOT ignored — VITE_API_URL is the only
# thing in it, and it's not a secret: Vite bakes it directly into the
# public JS bundle at build time regardless, visible to anyone via
# view-source. Excluding this file meant GitHub Actions' build step (see
# ../.github/workflows/deploy-frontend.yml) never had it, so every deploy
# silently fell back to the http://localhost:3000 dev default — working
# only on a machine that happened to have a local backend running on that
# port, breaking for literally everyone else.
